原文件的版权声明和许可条款继续有效，这里只改写说明文字和按 13T 调整的部分。

类别：板无关（GPU 用户态）。
作用：hw.pagesize 读取绕过沙盒的 sysctl 检查。WebKit GPU 进程的沙盒不让读，页大小变成 -1，
Metal 插件、Vulkan 桥和驱动都拒绝所有 IOSurface。
待核：17.7.11 上是否复现没有证据，27 上 sheng 复现过，带上。

diff --git a/bsd/kern/kern_newsysctl.c b/bsd/kern/kern_newsysctl.c
index 20d071c..7b0e929 100644
--- a/bsd/kern/kern_newsysctl.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/kern_newsysctl.c
@@ -1920,7 +1920,13 @@ found:
 	lck_rw_done(&sysctl_geometry_lock);
 
 #if CONFIG_MACF
-	if (!from_kernel) {
+	/*
+	 * Reading the page size (hw.pagesize, which getpagesize() and sysconf(_SC_PAGESIZE) ask) is left to everyone: the GPU's
+	 * userspace -- the Metal plugin, its Vulkan bridge and driver -- sizes its mappings by it inside WebKit's GPU process, whose
+	 * sandbox refuses the read, and a page size of -1 refused every IOSurface it was to draw into.
+	 */
+	const bool page_size_read = namelen == 2 && name[0] == CTL_HW && name[1] == HW_PAGESIZE && req->newptr == USER_ADDR_NULL;
+	if (!from_kernel && !page_size_read) {
 		error = mac_system_check_sysctlbyname(kauth_cred_get(),
 		    namestring,
 		    name,
